  "description": "**Important: Please Read Before Registering**<br/>To enquire about this property or attend a home open, you must register your interest via the \"Get in touch\" button on the listing. <br/><br/>Registering through Snug ensures you receive all updates, including inspection times, cancellations, time changes and any important information relating to the property.<br/>Simply adding the home open to your plan or calendar does not register your attendance and you may miss important updates.<br/><br/>Please note that you must inspect the property before applying. Snug applications will only be accepted once you have viewed the property.<br/><br/>**VIEWINGS**<br/>Please arrive on time for your inspection. For properties within secure complexes, our Leasing Consultant cannot leave the home open to provide building access once the inspection has commenced so it is recommended that you arrive prior to the start time. Late arrivals may be unable to access the property and could miss the opportunity to inspect.<br/><br/>______________________________________________________________________________________<br/><br/>Perfectly positioned in a sought-after pocket of Alkimos, this modern 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom home offers the ideal blend of comfort, convenience and low-maintenance living. Designed with functionality in mind, the home features a light-filled open plan living and dining area that seamlessly connects to the contemporary kitchen, creating the perfect space to relax or entertain. With quality finishes throughout, a secure double garage and easy-care outdoor spaces, this home is perfectly suited to families, couples or professionals seeking a coastal lifestyle close to everything you need.<br/><br/>Features:<br/>-3 spacious bedrooms<br/>-2 modern bathrooms<br/>-Open plan living and dining area<br/>-Well-appointed kitchen with ample storage<br/>-Split system air conditioning<br/>-Double remote garage<br/>-Low-maintenance courtyard<br/>-Easy-care block<br/>-Modern neutral dcor throughout<br/><br/>A little about the location:<br/>-Close to Alkimos Beach<br/>-Nearby parks and playgrounds<br/>-Minutes to Alkimos College and local primary schools<br/>-Convenient access to Butler and Alkimos Train Stations<br/>-Close to Trinity Village Shopping Centre<br/>-Easy access to Marmion Avenue and Mitchell Freeway extension<br/>-Surrounded by cafs, walking trails and coastal amenities<br/><br/>Available: 11th September<br/>Lease term: 12 months<br/><br/>Please include a cover letter in your application.<br/><br/>Life is Better with Xceed!",
